s `1998.9999\u2026` and becomes `1998`. The same happened with 0.29 and 4.35, so the subtotal, tax and discount tests all came out a cent or more short.\n\n**Fix:** changed that line to `return round(amount * 100)`. For prices with two decimal places, this always gives the intended number of cents.\n\n**Test setup:** plain `python3` here has no pytest, and the `pytest` on PATH is broken. I ran the tests with `PYTHONPATH=. uvx pytest -q tests`. Without `PYTHONPATH=.`, both test files fail to import `ledger` before any test runs.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 8, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 93788, "requests_cache_write": 14994, "requests_cost_usd": 0.12521960000000001, "requests_count": 8, "requests_input_uncached": 18, "requests_output": 1571, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial11", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 21, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T05:34:36.561238+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 24.866, "t_checker_s": 0.333, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1589, "tokens_cache_read": 93788, "tokens_cache_write": 14994, "tokens_fresh": 1589, "tokens_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_cache_read": 93788, "tokens_main_cache_write": 14994, "tokens_main_calls": 8, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_output": 1571, "tokens_output": 1571, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 93788, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 14994, "tokens_proxy_calls": 8, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_prox